Subject: --keep-versions, and VMS specifications as operands, on VMS

--keep-versions=N keeps the newest N versions of each file updated on
VMS (D4): it is passed to the receiver as RSYNC_KEEP_VERSIONS in the
environment, which a local --server inherits. Operands that are VMS
specifications (DISK$USER:[DIR]FILE.TXT, [.SUB]) become paths (D5),
vms/vms_at.c.

